{"translation":{"id":"ory_irv","name":"ଇଣ୍ଡିୟାନ ରିୱାଇସ୍ଡ୍ ୱରସନ୍ ଓଡିଆ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Oriya Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"ory","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"fe09301e6f43dbbcfcb30753438997976ee983751a3278733f551d91025dee13","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","languageEnglishName":"Odia"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"ory_irv","name":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","commonName":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","title":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"66539124e8124247ab4799343f0663cb93d027589d0e40219697891b1f630152","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":87,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ଯିରୂଶାଲମର ପ୍ରଶଂସା"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ଗୀତ; କୋରହ-ସନ୍ତାନଗଣର ଗୀତ।"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ତାହାଙ୍କ ଭିତ୍ତିମୂଳ ପବିତ୍ର ପର୍ବତ ଉପରେ ସ୍ଥାପିତ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁ ଯାକୁବର ସମସ୍ତ ବାସସ୍ଥାନ ଅପେକ୍ଷା","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସିୟୋନର ଦ୍ୱାରସମୂହକୁ ଅଧିକ ସ୍ନେହ କରନ୍ତି।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହେ ପରମେଶ୍ୱରଙ୍କ ନଗରୀ, ତୁମ୍ଭ ବିଷୟରେ ନାନାବିଧ ଗୌରବର କଥା କଥିତ ଅଛି। [ସେଲା]","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ମୋʼ ଜାଣିବା ଲୋକଙ୍କ ତୁଲ୍ୟ ମୁଁ ରାହବ ଓ ବାବିଲକୁ ଉଲ୍ଲେଖ କରିବି;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ପଲେଷ୍ଟୀୟା, ସୋର ଓ କୂଶକୁ ଦେଖ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“ଏହି ଜଣ ସେଠାରେ ଜାତ ହେଲା।”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଆହୁରି, ସିୟୋନ ବିଷୟରେ କୁହାଯିବ, “ଏଜଣ ଓ ସେଜଣ ତହିଁ ମଧ୍ୟରେ ଜାତ ହେଲେ;”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ପୁଣି, ସର୍ବୋପରିସ୍ଥ ସ୍ୱୟଂ ତାହା ସୁସ୍ଥିର କରିବେ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁ ଗୋଷ୍ଠୀବର୍ଗର ନାମ ଲେଖିବା ସମୟରେ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“ଏଜଣ ସେଠାରେ ଜାତ ହେଲା” ବୋଲି ଗଣନା କରିବେ। [ସେଲା]","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଗାୟକ ଓ ନର୍ତ୍ତକମାନେ କହିବେ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“ମୋହର ସବୁ ଝର ତୁମ୍ଭଠାରେ ଅଛି।”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}